lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nYang Hong is the head of a non-governmental organization, and Cheng Tian is his deputy. Now they are planning a charity event, and finally decide who is in charge of the fundraising event. At a meeting, Xiao Chen puts forward his fundraising idea, but he is not sure if his idea is acceptable. During Xiao Chen's introduction, Cheng Tian glances at Yang Hong, and his expression seems to have a question, but Yang Hong nods affirmatively. After Xiao Chen finishes, Cheng Tian and Yang Hong exchange opinions in a low voice. Xiao Chen sees the mutual smile between Cheng Tian and Yang Hong afterwards, and his expression is relieved.\n\n[Question]\nWhat do you think Xiao Chen is thinking?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Chen feels nervous and uneasy, not knowing whether his idea is acceptable.\nB. Xiao Chen feels excited and anticipatory because he has the opportunity to realize his idea.\nC. Xiao Chen is a bit worried because he worries that he is not capable of fundraising work.\nD. Xiao Chen keeps doubts at this moment, he is not sure whether the smile of Cheng Tian and Yang Hong indicates affirmation to him.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472546398958089,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58d1b9aa9dc5a833d5ba7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477339538,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:55:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2046b54482ee440788ecc13